  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;AMANDA J LEACH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Amanda J Leach is an Australian microbiologist who has been awarded the Member of the Order of Australia for her contributions to microbiology and public health."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0010</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MEMBER OF THE ORDER OF AUSTRALIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Member of the Order of Australia is a prestigious award given to individuals who have made significant contributions to their field and the community."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0010</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ORDER OF AUSTRALIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Order of Australia is one of Australia's highest civilian honors, recognizing individuals for their significant contributions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0010</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF SYDNEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The University of Sydney is an educational institution where Amanda J Leach works and is recognized for her contributions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0010</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CENTRE FOR INFECTIOUS DISEASES AND MICROBIOLOGY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Centre for Infectious Diseases and Microbiology is part of the University of Sydney where Amanda J Leach is the Director."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0010</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PROFESSOR IAN HENDERSON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Professor Ian Henderson is the Director of the Centre for Infectious Diseases and Microbiology at the University of Sydney and has praised Amanda J Leach's work."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0010</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JOURNAL OF CLINICAL MICROBIOLOGY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Journal of Clinical Microbiology is a peer-reviewed journal where Amanda J Leach has published her research."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0010</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INFECTION AND IMMUNITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Infection and Immunity is another peer-reviewed journal where Amanda J Leach has published her research."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0010</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AUSTRALIAN GOVERNMENT'S DEPARTMENT OF THE PRIME MINISTER AND CABINET&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Australian Government's Department of the Prime Minister and Cabinet has recognized Amanda J Leach for her service to medical research."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0010</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AUSTRALIAN ACADEMY OF SCIENCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Australian Academy of Science has provided data on Amanda J Leach's publications and citations."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0010</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SYDNEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sydney is the city where Amanda J Leach works and where she received her award."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0010</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OPERA HOUSE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Opera House is a famous landmark in Sydney where Amanda J Leach received her award."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0010</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ASSOCIATED PRESS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Associated Press has chosen Amanda J Leach as their Athlete of the Year, recognizing her unique blend of scientific and athletic talents."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0010</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AUSTRALIAN NATIONAL ROWING TEAM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Australian national rowing team is part of Amanda J Leach's athletic background and has supported her achievements."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0010</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BACTERIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bacteria are the subject of Amanda J Leach's research, particularly a resilient strain."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0010</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MICROBIOLOGY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Microbiology is the field of study that Amanda J Leach specializes in and contributes to."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0010</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PUBLIC HEALTH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Public health is an area where Amanda J Leach's work has had a significant impact."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0010</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DIAGNOSIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Diagnosis is an aspect of Amanda J Leach's work, particularly in developing new tools."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0010</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TREATMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Treatment is another area where Amanda J Leach's work has contributed, particularly in developing vaccines."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0010</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MENTORING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mentoring is mentioned as part of Amanda J Leach's commitment to inspiring the next generation of scientists."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0010</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROWING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Rowing is a sport that Amanda J Leach has participated in and excelled in."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0010</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EARLY MORNING TRAINING SESSIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Early morning training sessions are part of Amanda J Leach's athletic background."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0010</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HARBOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The harbor is where Amanda J Leach trained for rowing."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0010</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ATHLETES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Athletes are the category in which Amanda J Leach was recognized by the Associated Press."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0010</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OLYMPIC CHAMPIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Olympic champions are the typical recipients of the Athlete of the Year award, which Amanda J Leach also received."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0010</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RECORD-BREAKING ATHLETES&quot;">
